    "summary": "Set this model up from these sections:\n\n- exactly 1 platform section\n- no more than 5 shield sections\n- no more than 2 broken shield sections\n- no more than 2 end sections\n\nEvery section must join into one continuous defence line. Place both broken shield sections at an end of the line, or in its middle with no more than ½\" between them, where they count as connected. Once set up, all the sections count as one model for every rule.",
